# Godot's per-project import cache. Regenerated whenever the editor binds
# a project, including every time a gd tool starts a language server
# against fixtures/basic-gd. The .gd.uid files beside it are not cache —
# they are a script's stable identity, referenced by uid:// from scenes,
# so those stay committed.
.godot/
